// =============================================================================
// SaaS platform Prisma fragment: TenantAccessHold
// =============================================================================
//
// REFERENCE SNIPPET — see 01-subscription.prisma for conventions.
//
// One row per reason a tenant is held back (`SC-ADM-055`): an operator's
// suspension, an invoice unpaid on its due date, a subscription that ended, a
// deletion under way. A reason is open until `liftedAt` is set, and
// lifting one leaves the others as they are; the tenant's state is the strictest
// of its open reasons.
//
// The platform reads the open reasons of a tenant on every request of that
// tenant, so the table is small per tenant and indexed on the tenant.
//
// At most ONE open row per tenant, kind and reference. Prisma cannot express a
// partial unique index over an expression; the one that holds it is in
// sql/constraints.postgres.sql, together with the check on `kind`, and it is
// what makes a repeated run or two operators at once record a reason once.
//
// Required wherever tenants are served: the platform refuses to start without a
// place to keep the reasons, since a state that is not recorded is not enforced.

model TenantAccessHold {
    id         String    @id @default(uuid())
    // The tenant held back. Not a relation: the tenant model is the application's.
    tenantId   String
    // suspended | overdue | ended | deleting
    kind       String
    // What the reason is about, where it is about one thing: the overdue
    // invoice, the subscription that ended. Null for a suspension.
    reference  String?
    // The operator's words for a suspension.
    note       String?
    // When the reason began to hold, and who recorded it (an actor tag, as the
    // audit log writes it, or the run that did).
    since      DateTime
    recordedBy String
    // Set when the reason no longer holds.
    liftedAt   DateTime?
    liftedBy   String?
    createdAt  DateTime  @default(now())

    @@index([tenantId, liftedAt])
    @@map("tenant_access_holds")
}
